========================================================================
MODEL WEIGHTS
========================================================================

BOMLLM does NOT redistribute model weights.

The production reference build uses a community fine-tune published by
DavidAU on Hugging Face (a TURBO-series Fable merge based on a Qwen
27B-class model, NVFP4/MLX quant). Model weights are subject to the
upstream model licenses (Qwen license + the fine-tune author's terms).
Pull weights from the original author's Hugging Face repository and read
its model card and license before use.

Qwen model license: https://huggingface.co/Qwen (Apache-2.0 for most
Qwen3-series weights; verify the exact model you pull).

